=== rx-word-boundary-in-when
from: Gnome::N 0.1.54 lib/Gnome/N/GnomeRoutineCaller.rakumod:430
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: regex <|w>
--- code
for num32, num64, int32, Str {
    given $_ {
        when .^name ~~ / <|w> num / { say "{.^name}: numeric" }
        default { say "{.^name}: other" }
    }
}
--- expect
num32: numeric
num64: numeric
int32: other
Str: other
